ype': 'function'}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '{"ok": true, "huecos": [{"hueco_id": 4, "medico": "Dr. Lopez", "inicio": "2026-11-03T10:30:00Z", "cuando": "Tuesday November 03 at 10:30"}, {"hueco_id": 6, "medico": "Dr. Ruiz", "inicio": "2026-11-03T16:30:00Z", "cuando": "Tuesday November 03 at 16:30"}, {"hueco_id": 7, "medico": "Dr. Ruiz", "inicio": "2026-11-03T17:00:00Z", "cuando": "Tuesday November 03 at 17:00"}, {"hueco_id": 8, "medico": "Dr. Lopez", "inicio": "2026-11-04T09:00:00Z", "cuando": "Wednesday November 04 at 09:00"}, {"hueco_id": 10, "medico": "Dr. Lopez", "inicio": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z", "cuando": "Wednesday November 04 at 10:00"}, {"hueco_id": 11, "medico": "Dr. Lopez", "inicio": "2026-11-04T10:30:00Z", "cuando": "Wednesday November 04 at 10:30"}]}', 'tool_call_id': 'fc_1fd66017-4028-40d7-9ceb-adeaaf6215de'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "We have Tuesday at ten thirty in the morning with Dr. Lopez or Tuesday at four thirty in the afternoon with Dr. Ruiz. Which would you prefer? That's perfect; may I have your full name to confirm?... May I have your full name to book the appointment?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Oh... er, hold on. I'm not sure yet. I should check my calendar before I decide. Let me think about this one."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, take your time. Let me know whenever you’re ready to choose a slot.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Thank you. I think I'll call back once I've looked things over. Sorry to bother you, and good morning."}]
